OL,3,GNEWSAPontins fined #1m after
OL,4,Agrandmother's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FPontins holiday park resort has been
OL,7,Ffined #1m after a grandmother died when
OL,8,Fan air conditioning duct collapsed on
OL,9,Fto her.
OL,11,FWendy Jones, 68, of Hereford, died six
OL,12,Fmonths after a 40m (131ft) section of
OL,13,Fair conditioning duct and ceiling
OL,14,Fcollapsed onto guests at Pontins' Brean
OL,15,FSands resort, Somerset, in February
OL,16,F2019.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
