OL,3,GNEWSAPontins fined #1m after
OL,4,Agrandmother's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, Pontins' parent firm,
OL,7,FBritannia Jinky Jersey, was sentenced
OL,8,Fat Bristol Crown Court to pay a #1m
OL,9,Ffine and contractor, Stephen Bennison,
OL,10,Freceived a 10-month prison sentence,
OL,11,Fsuspended for 18 months.
OL,13,FThey both admitted failure to discharge
OL,14,Fa duty under health and safety laws.
